FlashAttention-4 public Fixed dependency and synchronization override
  https://github.com/Dao-AILab/flash-attention
  python/mbsa/cute/fixed_attention.py independently constructs exact Fixed
  block metadata and calls the installed flash-attn-4==4.0.0b20 wrapper.
  fixed_sync.py derives only the official public SM100 kernel method, with
  converged TMEM synchronization, guarded configurations and a private JIT
  cache. BSD-3-Clause license, AUTHORS, wheel/source/method/local hashes and
  adaptations are recorded under python/mbsa/third_party/fa4/. MBSA changes
  retain Apache-2.0 attribution. Fixed and Dynamic states remain separate.
  merge_vectorized.py is an original warp-owned/vector-copy implementation.

DeepGEMM
  https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepGEMM, via maxwell-model/DeepGEMM
